# Artifacts of `tests/perf --scenario=database-row-insert`. The scenario writes
# real rows into the workspace it measures, which for a dev run is the
# repository root, so one 300-row run leaves 300 documents, an owner table and
# a manifest behind. Untracked they bury `git status` — a single session
# accumulated 850, and the next reader cannot find their own changes.
/perf-row-*.md
/perf_row_insert_*-rows.md
/.ok/databases/perf_row_insert_*.yml

# Env files (keep .env.example committed)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
